    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Cantrip.</strong> You learn the Vicious Mockery cantrip. Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma is your spellcasting ability for it (choose when you take this feat).</p><p><strong>Smooth Talker.</strong> When you make a Charisma (Deception, Intimidation, or Persuasion) check, you can roll 1d4 and add the number rolled to the check.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-qWPtWQqbdGe1Wrgw\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The 1d4 is added to these three skills automatically.</p></section>",
